<Slide>
  <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0B1120', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    {/* A 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 96, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderBottom: '2px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3)' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2 }}>第 3 章 · 主循环</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>串口中断状态机：uart1_mode 怎么定</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* B 内容区：左状态机 SVG + 右说明 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 560, background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 10, padding: '10px 12px', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <svg width='536' height='400' viewBox='0 0 536 400' style={{ display: 'block' }}>
          <defs><marker id='ar2' markerWidth='10' markerHeight='10' refX='8' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L8,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748B' /></marker></defs>
          <rect x='20' y='40' width='150' height='56' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#3B82F6' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='95' y='74' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>收到一个字节</text>
          <text x='95' y='135' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle'>uart1_mode==0 ?</text>
          <rect x='20' y='170' width='150' height='70' rx='8' fill='#0B1120' stroke='#FBBF24' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='95' y='198' fill='#FBBF24' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>首字符定 mode</text>
          <text x='95' y='220' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12' textAnchor='middle'>$/#/&lcub;/&lt;/S</text>
          <rect x='230' y='170' width='150' height='70' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#3B82F6' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='305' y='198' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>buf 累加</text>
          <text x='305' y='220' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12' textAnchor='middle'>uart_receive_buf[i++]</text>
          <rect x='440' y='170' width='150' height='70' rx='8' fill='#0B1120' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2.5' />
          <text x='515' y='198' fill='#06B6D4' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>结束符</text>
          <text x='515' y='220' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12' textAnchor='middle'>!/&rbrace;/&gt;/D</text>
          <path d='M170 205 H230' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar2)' />
          <path d='M380 205 H440' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar2)' />
          <path d='M515 240 V300 H95 V240' fill='none' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='1.5' />
          <rect x='20' y='300' width='150' height='60' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#FBBF24' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='95' y='328' fill='#FBBF24' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>uart1_get_ok=1</text>
          <text x='95' y='350' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12' textAnchor='middle'>主循环来取</text>
          <text x='270' y='388' fill='#64748B' fontSize='12'>USART1 与 USART3 共用同一套状态机</text>
        </svg>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
          每次串口收到一个字节就进 <span style={{ color: '#FBBF24' }}>USARTx_IRQHandler</span>。关键在两点：<Box /><br />
          ① <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>mode==0 时看首字符</span>：<span style={{ color: '#FBBF24' }}>$</span>→1、<span style={{ color: '#FBBF24' }}>#</span>→2、<span style={{ color: '#FBBF24' }}>&lcub;</span>→3、<span style={{ color: '#FBBF24' }}> &lt; </span>→4、<span style={{ color: '#FBBF24' }}>S</span>→5。
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            ② <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>对应结束符</span>：<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>!</span>(1/2)、<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>&rbrace;</span>(3)、<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}> &gt; </span>(4)、<span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>D</span>(5) → 置 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>uart1_get_ok=1</span>。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(251,191,36,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', borderLeft: '4px solid #FBBF24' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
            若 <span style={{ color: '#FBBF24' }}>uart1_get_ok</span> 已为 1，中断直接 return 丢字节——防止解析途中新帧打断。所以发送端不要在板子「忙」时狂发。
          </Text>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* C 页脚 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>六轴机械臂代码详解</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>23 / 41</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
